        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e142575-830c-4e58-8bdb-8d39b613e406).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47.\rHilda Berg, Erik Olander and Alden Hansson all have business in the embassy in Marrakesh. Hilda is currently selling swedish millitary secrets to Moroccan militia somewhere in the city, whilst her partner&apos;s Erik and Alden are cooped up in the embassy, trying to cover their tracks and burn the rather large paper trail they&apos;ve made themselves.\rThis contract is very sensitive. As a result the client would like to keep bloodshed to a minimum and erase any footage.\rGood luck 47.",
